    "summary": "As the Fight phase starts, if this unit is in **Engagement Range** of any enemy unit, you may destroy one of its models. If you do, pick an enemy unit that model is in Engagement Range of and roll a D6, plus 1 against a **VEHICLE**:\n\n- a result of 2–5 inflicts D3 **mortal wounds** on that unit\n- a result of 6+ inflicts 3 mortal wounds on that unit",
